@startuml
actor Player
participant ":System" as System

Player -> System: 1. Requests to assign a train to a route
System -> Player: 2. Lists available trains and asks to select one
Player -> System: 3. Selects a train

loop While Player wants to add more stations
    System -> Player: 4. Lists possible stations and requests selection
    Player -> System: 5. Selects one station
    System -> Player: 6. Lists possible cargo types to pick up at station

    Player -> System: 8. Selects cargo to pick up
end

System -> Player: 9. Displays route and cargo summary, requests confirmation
Player -> System: 10. Confirms data
System -> Player: 11. Displays operation success

@enduml
